01:03:55.450 --> 01:03:57.370
We're born for each other.


01:03:58.120 --> 01:03:59.660
Did I do my tie well?


01:04:12.250 --> 01:04:14.870
Well? Did you see her?


01:04:15.040 --> 01:04:19.040
