01:05:43.160 --> 01:05:45.500
My friend and I used to
eat intestines downstairs


01:05:47.080 --> 01:05:48.410
I fell in love with you


01:05:50.450 --> 01:05:52.580
the first time I
set my eyes on you


01:05:55.160 --> 01:05:57.080
