01:10:47.870 --> 01:10:48.870
Quick.


01:10:49.410 --> 01:10:50.250
What's going on?


01:10:50.950 --> 01:10:53.580
Let's go I heard you
were heartbroken?


01:10:53.750 --> 01:10:55.120
